  "question": {
    "text": "The equation&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#8211;</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mo>[</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>]</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>[</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>]</mo></math>, where&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>[</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>]</mo></math>&nbsp;denotes the greatest integer function, has:"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "exactly two solutions in&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mo>-</mo><mo>&#8734;</mo><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8734;</mo><mo>)</mo></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "no solution",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "a unique solution in&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mo>-</mo><mo>&#8734;</mo><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "a unique solution in&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mo>-</mo><mo>&#8734;</mo><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8734;</mo><mo>)</mo></math>",
